 152+ 6C38 B7               or   a
 153+ 6C39 ED 52            sbc  hl, de
 154+ 6C3B 20 04            jr   nz, .not_foottree
 155+ 6C3D
 156+ 6C3D 3E 04            ld   a, 4               ; Room ID = 4
 157+ 6C3F 18 2F            jr   .set_room
 158+ 6C41
 159+ 6C41              .not_foottree:
